  "keyFeatures": [
    "Single OpenAI-compatible API for 20+ AI providers",
    "Automatic failover and fallback chains",
    "Weighted load balancing across API keys and providers",
    "Virtual Keys for access control, budgets, and rate limits",
    "Semantic caching to reduce costs and latency",
    "MCP Gateway: connect AI models to external tools",
    "Built-in observability with Prometheus and OpenTelemetry",
    "Enterprise guardrails, audit logs, and RBAC",
    "Drop-in replacement for OpenAI, Anthropic, Google GenAI SDKs",
    "Custom Go/WASM plugins for extensible middleware",
    "Bifrost Edge for endpoint-level AI governance"
